Package: SelectPie
Type: Package
Title: MLE for Compositional Models with Sample Selection
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
	     person("Erik", "Chi", email = "erikchi@tamu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")), 
	     person("Thiago", "Moreira", email = "tmoreira@lsu.edu", role = c("aut")),
	     person("Guy", "Whitten", email = "g-whitten@tamu.edu", role = c("aut")),
	     person("Yongzhi", "Xu", email = "xuyongzhi6@outlook.com", role = c("aut"))
            )
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation for compositional outcome models that
  account for selection into the sample using a bivariate extreme value (Gumbel-logistic) distribution.
  The core estimation function is SelectPie(). Other supporting functions are provided for supporting the estimation,
  post-estimation predictions and simulations, converting log-ratios back to shares, and latex table utilities. 
